  "title": "Turtle Beach Corporation Announces First Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "–Generated $29.4 Million in Cash Flow from Operations– –Reaffirmed Full Year 2026 Net Revenue and Adjusted EBITDA Guidance– SAN DIEGO, May 07, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Turtle Beach Corporation (Nasdaq: TBCH), a leading gaming accessories brand, today reported financial results for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026 and reaffirmed full year 2026 guidance for net revenue and adjusted EBITDA. First Quarter Highlights Net Revenue of $42.2 million. Gross Margins of 26.8%. Net Loss of ($15.2)",
